From: Arena Agent <agent@arena.ai>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 08:55:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] i686: register-base GEP fold uses offset(%reg) addressing
 directly
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

emit_load/store_with_const_offset re-materialized the address for every
access when the folded GEP base lived in a register:
  movl %ebx, %ecx; addl $40, %ecx; movl (%ecx), %eax   (3 insns, 2 regs)
now:
